card-text-truncated card-text-truncated-size-md"><h5 class=card-title>ResCon</h5><p class=card-text><strong>ResCon</strong> (Research Conclave) is IIT Bombay&rsquo;s premier undergraduate research forum organized by <strong>EnPoWER</strong> in collaboration with <strong>IRCC</strong>, as part of TechConnect. It aims to <strong>nurture research curiosity</strong> among undergraduates and provide a platform to <strong>present their work</strong>, <strong>engage in competitions</strong> and <strong>interact with experts</strong>.<br><br>ResCon (2025) revolved around three core themes - <strong>Soch</strong> (Ideate), <strong>Vichar</strong> (Reflect), and <strong>Achar</strong> (Act) - creating an environment that encourages innovation, critical thinking, and actionable solutions to real-world challenges.</p></div></div></div><div class="col col-12
