largecolscroll-card card-size-min-height-xxl card-text-truncated-size-xxl" tabindex=0><img class="card-img-top img-div" src=/media/images/techconnect/profile/testimonial/Gourish_Singhal.jpg alt="Mr. Gourish Singhal" loading=lazy></img><div class="card-body text-center
card-text-truncated card-text-truncated-size-lg"><h4 class=card-title>Mr. Gourish Singhal</h4><p class=card-text>(<em>Overall Student Coordinator, TechConnect 2023, IIT Bombay</em>)</p><p class="card-text
text-left">TechConnect is the ultimate platform to showcase IIT Bombay&rsquo;s
pioneering research and transformative projects. Building on last
year&rsquo;s successful efforts to connect innovators with industry
leaders and experts, I am confident it will continue to spark
collaborations that shape the future.</p></div></div></div><div class="p-2 largecolscroll-col
align-items-center justify-content-center"><div class="card bg-transparent card-div
largecolscroll-card card-size-min-height-xxl card-text-truncated-size-xxl" tabindex=0><img class="card-img-top img-div" src=/media/images/techconnect/profile/testimonial/Swaroop_Ganguly.jpg alt="Prof. Swaroop Ganguly" loading=lazy></img><div class="card-body text-center
card-text-truncated card-text-truncated-size-lg"><h4 class=card-title>Prof. Swaroop Ganguly</h4><p class=card-text>(<em>Professor-in-Charge, Research Park, IIT Bombay</em>)</p><p class="card-text
text-left">Every year, IIT Bombay hosts TechConnect, a unique platform that brings
together students, faculty, entrepreneurs, and industry personnel. It
offers a fantastic opportunity for IIT Bombay faculty members and
students to showcase the best of their innovation, besides facilitating
immersive interaction between industry and academia. This year, ASPIRE,
the IIT Bombay Research Park, is pleased to join hands with the Industrial
Research Consultancy Centre, IIT Bombay, in supporting this exceptional
initiative. TechConnect resonates with ASPIRE’s mission to create an
ecosystem that facilitates seamless knowledge exchange, and translation
of ideas into tangible outcomes through collaboration across diverse
domains.</p></div></div></div><div class="p-2 largecolscroll-col
align-items-center justify-content-center"><div class="card bg-transparent card-div
largecolscroll-card card-size-min-height-xxl card-text-truncated-size-xxl" tabindex=0><img class="card-img-top img-div" src=/media/images/techconnect/profile/testimonial/Harish_Mehta.jpg alt="Mr. Harish Mehta" loading=lazy></img><div class="card-body text-center
card-text-truncated card-text-truncated-size-lg"><h4 class=card-title>Mr. Harish Mehta</h4><p class=card-text>(<em>TechConnect 2023 Chief Guest, Founder & EC @OnwardTech, 1st Elected Chairman at NASSCOM</em>)</p><p class="card-text
text-left">TechConnect 2023 was remarkable! Witnessing IIT Bombay&rsquo;s
cutting-edge R&amp;D and engaging with brilliant minds reaffirmed
India&rsquo;s tech potential. The appreciation for The Maverick Effect
story underscored the power of innovation and collaboration.
TechConnect inspires India&rsquo;s future as a global tech leader. Kudos
IIT Bombay for driving impactful progress!</p></div></div></div><div class="p-2 largecolscroll-col
align-items-center justify-content-center"><div class="card bg-transparent card-div
largecolscroll-card card-size-min-height-xxl card-text-truncated-size-xxl" tabindex=0><img class="card-img-top img-div" src=/media/images/techconnect/profile/testimonial/R_Murugavel.jpg alt="Prof. R. Murugavel" loading=lazy></img><div class="card-body text-center
card-text-truncated card-text-truncated-size-lg"><h4 class=card-title>Prof. R. Murugavel</h4><p class=card-text>(<em>Professor-in-charge, Institution of Eminence Cell, IIT Bombay</em>)</p><p class="card-text
text-left">Over the years the IIT Bombay TechConnect, which is concurrently conducted
along with the annual Techfest, has been a major facilitator for promoting
collaboration, knowledge exchange, and bridging the gap between academic
research advancements and the real-world technological applications. Through
this platform, IIT Bombay has managed to bring face-to-face the smartest minds
from academia, industry, and the entrepreneurial ecosystem to exchange ideas
and learn from each other. I have been a regular visitor to the TechConnect stalls
during the Techfest over the years and I was always amazed by the amount of
talent and innovation that is showcased through the prototypes at display. The IIT
Bombay “Institution of Eminence” project has been privileged to be part of this
activity for the last 3 years by providing support through the project’s outreach
vertical. I wish great success for this year’s event as it has been for last several
years.</p></div></div></div><div class="p-2 largecolscroll-col
align-items-center justify-content-center"><div class="card bg-transparent card-div
largecolscroll-card card-size-min-height-xxl card-text-truncated-size-xxl" tabindex=0><img class="card-img-top img-div" src=/media/images/techconnect/profile/testimonial/Vikram_Vishal.jpg alt="Prof. Vikram Vishal" loading=lazy></img><div class="card-body text-center
card-text-truncated card-text-truncated-size-lg"><h4 class=card-title>Prof. Vikram Vishal</h4><p class=card-text>(<em>Faculty Coordinator, TechConnect 2023, IIT Bombay</em>)</p><p class="card-text
text-left">TechConnect is a unique platform that brings together cutting-edge
research and innovation from academic units and incubated startups
at IIT Bombay. I had the privilege of serving as one of the faculty
coordinators for the past two seasons, which provided me with an
incredible opportunity to engage with groups working on
fundamental as well as applied scientific research. I was able to
witness firsthand the diverse range of working demonstration
models, which deepened my understanding of the interdisciplinary
nature of innovation in technology. Working closely with the
organizing team, comprising students, staff, and professors, was both
a pleasure and a highly rewarding experience.</p></div></div></div><div class="p-2 largecolscroll-col
align-items-center justify-content-center"><div class="card bg-transparent card-div
largecolscroll-card card-size-min-height-xxl card-text-truncated-size-xxl" tabindex=0><img class="card-img-top img-div" src=/media/images/techconnect/profile/testimonial/Raghavendra_Saroor.jpg alt="Mr. Raghavendra Saroor" loading=lazy></img><div class="card-body text-center
card-text-truncated card-text-truncated-size-lg"><h4 class=card-title>Mr. Raghavendra Saroor</h4><p class=card-text>(<em>Programme Manager, Rolls-Royce India Pvt. Ltd.</em>)</p><p class="card-text
text-left">Tech Symposium organised by IIT-B gave an insight in to the fundamental research activities performed by both Mechanical & Aerospace engineering departments. It really helped me to understand their depth of knowledge, enthusiasm that students and faculty demonstrated. The event provoked a thought on how industry can engage more with academia to meet the rapidly evolving aerospace / engineering ecosystem in India. As an offshoot of this, an MoU was signed between Rolls-Royce India Ltd. & IIT-B to enable knowledge exchange and upskilling, and to explore opportunities to collaborate on joint projects in areas of mutual interest. As part of this Rolls-Royce has selected a batch of students for internship programme to work and learn alongside engineering team in Bengaluru.</p></div></div></div><div class="p-2 largecolscroll-col
align-items-center justify-content-center"><div class="card bg-transparent card-div
largecolscroll-card card-size-min-height-xxl card-text-truncated-size-xxl" tabindex=0><img class="card-img-top img-div" src=/media/images/techconnect/profile/testimonial/Harsh_Sethi.jpg alt="Dr. Harsh Sethi" loading=lazy></img><div class="card-body text-center
card-text-truncated card-text-truncated-size-lg"><h4 class=card-title>Dr. Harsh Sethi</h4><p class=card-text>(<em>CEO & Founder, TriNANO Technologies Pvt. Ltd.</em>)</p><p class="card-text
text-left">Techconnect2024 proved to be transformative experience for TriNano Technologies.
The program&rsquo;s comprehensive curriculum, expert mentorship and networking
opportunities have positioned us for success. We are confident that the
knowledge and connections we gained at TechConnect2024 will be instrumental in
driving our future growth. We highly recommend TechConnect2025 to Startup
looking to accelerate their growth and connect with the right resources.</p></div></div></div><div class="p-2 largecolscroll-col
align-items-center justify-content-center"><div class="card bg-transparent card-div
largecolscroll-card card-size-min-height-xxl card-text-truncated-size-xxl" tabindex=0><img class="card-img-top img-div" src=/media/images/techconnect/profile/testimonial/Aaryan_Gupta.jpg alt="Mr. Aaryan Gupta" loading=lazy></img><div class="card-body text-center
card-text-truncated card-text-truncated-size-lg"><h4 class=card-title>Mr. Aaryan Gupta</h4><p class=card-text>(<em>Student Volunteer, TechConnect 2022, IIT Bombay</em>)</p><p class="card-text
text-left">My experience as a student coordinator for TechConnect was
incredible. I had the opportunity to interact with professors and
scholars, learning about 90 different technologies developed at
IITB, truly appreciating the &lsquo;T&rsquo; of IIT. I also had the privilege of
hosting Dr. V. Narayanan, Director of LPSC at ISRO, and was
inspired by his dedication to India&rsquo;s space sector, especially when
I saw him on TV during the successful Chandrayaan launch. This
role not only honed my organizational skills but also expanded
my network and deepened my understanding of various
technologies.</p></div></div></div><div class="p-2 largecolscroll-col
align-items-center justify-content-center"><div class="card bg-transparent card-div
largecolscroll-card card-size-min-height-xxl card-text-truncated-size-xxl" tabindex=0><img class="card-img-top img-div" src=/media/images/techconnect/profile/testimonial/Poyni_Bhatt.jpg alt="Ms. Poyni Bhatt" loading=lazy></img><div class="card-body text-center
card-text-truncated card-text-truncated-size-lg"><h4 class=card-title>Ms. Poyni Bhatt</h4><p class=card-text>(<em>Startup Advisor, Former CEO, Society for Innovation and Entrepreneurship</em>)</p><p class="card-text
text-left">Initiated over a decade ago, TechConnect at IIT Bombay began as a
catalyst for industry-academia interaction. It has since evolved into
a premier platform for showcasing application-oriented research,
innovations, startup products and solutions from IIT Bombay and
its incubator SINE. Today, this annual event draws significant
industry attention, inspires students from schools and universities,
and exemplifies IIT Bombay&rsquo;s commitment to innovation and
impactful engagement.</p></div></div></div><div class="p-2 largecolscroll-col
align-items-center justify-content-center"><div class="card bg-transparent card-div
largecolscroll-card card-size-min-height-xxl card-text-truncated-size-xxl" tabindex=0><img class="card-img-top img-div" src=/media/images/techconnect/profile/testimonial/Ambarish_Kunwar.jpg alt="Prof. Ambarish Kunwar" loading=lazy></img><div class="card-body text-center
card-text-truncated card-text-truncated-size-lg"><h4 class=card-title>Prof. Ambarish Kunwar</h4><p class=card-text>(<em>Department of Biosciences and Bioengineering, IIT Bombay</em>)</p><p class="card-text
text-left">TechConnect is a unique platform that provides opportunity to IIT Bombay faculty
members and students to showcase their cutting-edge research and innovation
from their labs. I enjoyed the opportunity of showcasing different products
developed in my lab that are ready for licensing as well as other prototypes of
microscopes that can be used for education in resource-constrained settings. It
was a great experience to meet people coming from different walks of life as well as students from different parts of the country, who are keen to learn about
various research and development activities happening in IIT Bombay. The
support received from IRCC in showcasing our research has been phenomenal!</p></div></div></div><div class="p-2 largecolscroll-col
align-items-center justify-content-center"><div class="card bg-transparent card-div
largecolscroll-card card-size-min-height-xxl card-text-truncated-size-xxl" tabindex=0><img class="card-img-top img-div" src=/media/images/techconnect/profile/testimonial/Prasanna_Gandhi.jpg alt="Prof. Prasanna Gandhi" loading=lazy></img><div class="card-body text-center
card-text-truncated card-text-truncated-size-lg"><h4 class=card-title>Prof. Prasanna Gandhi</h4><p class=card-text>(<em>Professor-in-Charge, IITB-Monash Research Academy</em>)</p><p class="card-text
text-left">TechConnect at IIT Bombay is an extraordinary platform that
brilliantly exhibits academic research, startup innovations to
industry and society at large. Serving as a faculty coordinator in
2020 and 2022, I gained unique insights into the vibrant
technological ecosystem. Working closely with an exceptional
organizing team of passionate students, dedicated staff, and
visionary professors was both inspiring and rewarding. From
fundamental scientific research to applied technologies,
TechConnect provides an unparalleled opportunity to witness how
creative minds transform complex challenges into groundbreaking
solutions, highlighting the collaborative spirit that drives
technological advancement.</p></div></div></div><div class="p-2 largecolscroll-col
