align-items-center justify-content-center"><div id=faqsection class="accordion accordion-flush"><div class="accordion-item custom-accordion-item"><h2 id=accordion-item-head-id-1791164205640891764 class=accordion-header><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type=button data-bs-toggle=collapse data-bs-target=#accordion-item-body-id-1791164205640891764 aria-expanded=false aria-controls=accordion-item-body-id-1791164205640891764>
What is the main objective of this event?</button></h2><div id=accordion-item-body-id-1791164205640891764 class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby=accordion-item-head-id-1791164205640891764 data-bs-parent=#faqsection><div class=accordion-body>The event aims to disseminate IIT Bombay's cutting-edge technologies to the
industry, students, and society at large.</div></div></div><div class="accordion-item custom-accordion-item"><h2 id=accordion-item-head-id-1791164205641193519 class=accordion-header><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type=button data-bs-toggle=collapse data-bs-target=#accordion-item-body-id-1791164205641193519 aria-expanded=false aria-controls=accordion-item-body-id-1791164205641193519>
What are the dates and timings for TechConnect?</button></h2><div id=accordion-item-body-id-1791164205641193519 class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby=accordion-item-head-id-1791164205641193519 data-bs-parent=#faqsection><div class=accordion-body>TechConnect 2026 will be held from 16 December 2026, to 18 December 2026.</div></div></div><div class="accordion-item custom-accordion-item"><h2 id=accordion-item-head-id-1791164205641496997 class=accordion-header><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type=button data-bs-toggle=collapse data-bs-target=#accordion-item-body-id-1791164205641496997 aria-expanded=false aria-controls=accordion-item-body-id-1791164205641496997>
Is the exhibition and symposium open to all?</button></h2><div id=accordion-item-body-id-1791164205641496997 class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby=accordion-item-head-id-1791164205641496997 data-bs-parent=#faqsection><div class=accordion-body>Yes, the exhibition as well as the symposium at IIT Bombay are free public
events, and are open to all attendees.</div></div></div><div class="accordion-item custom-accordion-item"><h2 id=accordion-item-head-id-1791164205641788713 class=accordion-header><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type=button data-bs-toggle=collapse data-bs-target=#accordion-item-body-id-1791164205641788713 aria-expanded=false aria-controls=accordion-item-body-id-1791164205641788713>
How do I get to IIT Bombay for the event?</button></h2><div id=accordion-item-body-id-1791164205641788713 class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby=accordion-item-head-id-1791164205641788713 data-bs-parent=#faqsection><div class=accordion-body><p>The entrance to IIT Bombay for the event will be through the Main Gate, IITB (
<a href=https://maps.app.goo.gl/5RGfTf23uWxir6Qt5>GMaps</a> ).
Upon arrival, clear directions will be provided to guide you to the
TechConnect 2026 Exhibition location. &lt;!&ndash;, which is part of the TechFest event.</p><p>Location: <a href=https://maps.app.goo.gl/QqTpnb4u4yN8dgqb7>Parking Lot, Dept. of Physics - IITB | G-Map</a>.</p><p>For more details, check out <a href={{ $base }}/event/exhibition/>Exhibition</a>, <a href={{ $base }}/event/symposium/>Symposium</a> and <a href={{ $base }}/rescon/>ResCon</a> pages.
